5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure the person who manages the money doesn't have too much work. What should we look at?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a concrete basis for the fee. I want to avoid guesswork this time to ensure the budget is actually sustainable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree we need facts. However, we should also consider how the fee structure affects the atmosphere for new members.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I want to know why some of our lovely regulars are acting so indecisive lately.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get carried away with ""atmospheres."" I'm more interested in who is actually doing the work and who is just coasting.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, that makes sense. I wonder if the treasurer's logs would tell us how hard the job is?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That's one thing, but we first need to know exactly what went out and what actually came in.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I think looking at the sign-up records for mid-year joiners would be useful to see how people enter the club.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, that's a bit dry, isn't it? I'm more curious about the actual turnout on weekdays.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the logs are a start, but the sign-in sheets will tell us the real story of who is actually here.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I see. I'll look into the treasurer's hours and the ledger to understand the workload and the costs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the bank statements and the ledger. We need to know the actual cash flow.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms from non-joiners.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'll take the weekday turnout and the tally of the sign-in sheets. Let's see who's actually showing up!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the rota against the attendance record and the tally of the sign-in sheets. Let's see who's carrying the load.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
