33,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that chasing small payments takes a lot of time. I'm worried about the next treasurer.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The ledger shows that most of our costs are fixed. We cannot afford to underestimate the base fee.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,It seems that a rigid annual fee is a barrier for newcomers. Many are hesitant to commit to a full year immediately.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"It's quite sad, really. People are treating our evenings like a luxury they have to budget for, rather than a home.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's worse than that. A handful of us are doing all the work while others pay a pittance and barely show up.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if we have fixed costs, maybe a single yearly payment is easier for everyone?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"In theory, yes. But the bank statements show that many members struggle to pay a lump sum upfront.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"If we make the fee too visible or too rigid, we risk losing the casual nature that makes this place welcoming.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! If we make it feel like a transaction, people will keep weighing up whether it's ""worth it"" to come out.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minako, ""welcoming"" shouldn't mean ""free labor"" for the regulars. The imbalance in attendance is staggering.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just don't want the next person to spend their whole evening doing paperwork. That doesn't seem very peaceful.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We must balance the treasurer's workload with the reality that our account is thinner than it appears.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need a system that is fair but doesn't require a complex audit of every single person's contribution.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"Let's find a way to make it feel effortless. The less we talk about the money, the more they'll come back.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Effortless for whom? The people who don't show up? I think it's time we stopped pretending everyone contributes equally.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
